	(text "Only one channel of the AD4130-8 is modelled and other channels and related functions and pins are not modeled.The following parameters can be \ndefined by right-clicking on the AD4130-8 symbol. \n \nGAIN= 1,  2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128\nsets the gain of PGA.\nPGA_BYP=0,1\n0 for disable PGA bypass, 1 for enable PGA bypass\nI1/2 = 0.1u, 10u, 20u, 50u, 100u, 150u, 200u\ncontrol the two excitation sources IOUT1 and IOUT2 respectively with values specified in the Datasheet.\nREF_SELECT=0, 1.25, 2.5\nset which reference voltage to use, set 0 to use external voltage set through REF_P and REF_M pins.\nCLK_SEL=0, 1\n set to 0 to observe the internal clock at the CLK pin,  set to 1 to use an external clock\nFS_WORD=1 to 2047\n set to any integer value from 1 to 2047 to change Output Data Rate(ODR) of the ADC between 1.17SPS to 2.4kSPS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 80.1116 0)
		(effects
